</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="499.632" endTime="512.716">
<Sync time="499.632"/>
Pos te:ta:liliah sake:ra na..., naw..., na:wi, na:wi *viaje o** e:yi *viaje**, mm.
<Sync time="506.033"/>
e:yi, e:yi, koma[mo] seki te:ta:liliah ihko:ni, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="512.716" endTime="516.298">
<Sync time="512.716"/>
Xiwtsi:n tein kikwih tein sehselik oso tein chihchika:wak.
